  "goodToKnow": "Die Packung is a packet or pack of something you buy: eine Packung Nudeln, eine Packung Zigaretten. A parcel sent by post, however, is das Paket. Every German medicine contains a Packungsbeilage (patient leaflet), and TV ads end with the famous line Zu Risiken und Nebenwirkungen lesen Sie die Packungsbeilage. In sport slang, eine Packung kriegen means to suffer a heavy defeat. A beauty face mask is also a Packung."
